[Slow] 福田さんは、10月22日に、心不全のため東京の病院で亡くなりました。

28
00:03:00,427 --> 00:03:05,276
[Host] He died of heart failure on October twenty-second at a hospital in Tokyo.

29
00:03:05,876 --> 00:03:08,443
[Vocab] 心不全

30
00:03:08,843 --> 00:03:10,764
[Host] It means heart failure.

31
